(5, 'Do you provide fresh fruits and vegetables daily?', 'Yes, we source fresh fruits and vegetables daily fresh.', 'active'),
(6, 'Where do you source your products from?', 'We source our produce from verified local farmers and certified suppliers who follow quality and hygiene standards.', 'active'),
(7, 'What are your delivery hours?', 'Our delivery hours are from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM, depending on location and slot availability.', 'active'),
(8, 'Is there a minimum order value for delivery?', 'Yes, the minimum order value is ₹199. Free delivery is available on orders above ₹499.', 'active'),
(9, 'What are your delivery hours?', 'Our delivery hours are from 9:00 AM to 9:00 PM, depending on location and slot availability.', 'active'),
(10, 'How can I place an order?', 'You can place an order through our website or app by selecting products, adding them to the cart, and completing checkout.', 'active'),
(11, 'What payment methods do you accept?', 'We accept UPI, debit cards, credit cards, net banking, and cash on delivery.', 'active'),
(12, 'How do you ensure product freshness during delivery?', 'We use hygienic packaging and proper handling practices to maintain freshness during transportation.', 'active'),
(13, 'Are salad bowls and fruit bowls freshly prepared?', 'Yes, all salad bowls and fruit bowls are freshly prepared after the order is placed.', 'active'),
(14, 'Are fresh juices made without preservatives?', 'Yes, our fresh juices are prepared without preservatives or artificial additives.', 'active'),
(16, 'What happens if a product is out of stock after ordering?', 'In such cases, we inform the customer and offer a suitable replacement or refund as preferred.', 'active'),
(17, 'Will you introduce express delivery within 1 hour?', 'We are currently exploring the possibility of introducing 1-hour express delivery in selected areas in the near future', 'draft'),
(18, 'Are you planning to introduce a loyalty rewards program?', 'Yes, we are working on a rewards system where customers can earn points on every purchase.', 'draft'),
(19, 'Will subscription-based weekly vegetable boxes be available?', 'We are planning to launch weekly and monthly subscription boxes for regular customers soon.', 'draft'),
(20, 'Do you plan to expand delivery to nearby cities?', 'Expansion to additional cities is under consideration based on demand and operational feasibility.', 'draft'),
(21, 'Are you planning to launch a mobile application?', 'Yes, we are in the early stages of developing a dedicated mobile application.', 'draft'),
(22, 'Will there be exclusive offers for premium members?', 'A premium membership model with exclusive discounts is currently under planning.', 'draft'),
(23, 'Do you offer international shipping?', 'International shipping is not available at this time.', 'inactive'),
(24, 'Do you offer midnight delivery services?', 'Midnight deliveries are not available currently.', 'inactive'),
(25, 'Do you provide franchise opportunities?', 'Franchise opportunities are not open at this time.\n', 'inactive');

